      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this might be due to the mirrors.  After being in a world for a good while and leaving a mirror enabled FPS goes down the drain from my usual 45 - 90 to 15. The FPS problem seems to also happen across worlds. For example I was at void and we started to have this lag problem.  I turned off the mirror and the lag went away. I switched worlds to my home world which is very small but has a mirror enabled by default and I had the same 15 fps even in my homeworld and nobody else there.  Turning off the mirror brought my fps back up to 90.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
